<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy" description="Read the MushroomScope privacy policy, including information about analytics, consent, storage, and your choices."><div class="shell py-8"><Breadcrumbs items={[{label:'Privacy Policy'}]} /></div><article class="shell max-w-4xl py-12"><h1 class="font-serif text-5xl">Privacy Policy</h1><p class="mt-3 text-sm text-slate-500">Last updated: August 1, 2026</p><div class="prose mt-8"><p>MushroomScope is designed to collect as little personal information as practical. This policy explains the limited information processed when you visit the site and the choices available to you.</p><h2>Google Analytics</h2><p>With your permission, MushroomScope uses Google Analytics 4 to understand aggregate site usage, including page views, general traffic sources, device categories, countries, anonymous site-search activity, and clicks to related guides. We do not send the words you enter into MushroomScope search to Google Analytics, and our custom analytics events do not include names, email addresses, message contents, or other information intended to identify you.</p><p>Google Analytics may process technical information such as an IP address, browser information, device information, and identifiers used to distinguish visits. Learn <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites" rel="external">how Google uses information from sites that use its services</a>.</p><h2>Consent and storage</h2><p>Analytics and advertising consent are denied by default. The Google Analytics tag is not loaded unless you allow analytics. Your choice is stored in your browser so the site can remember it. You can accept all optional categories, reject them, or choose categories individually.</p><p>If you withdraw analytics consent, MushroomScope removes its accessible Google Analytics cookies and reloads the page without the analytics tag. You can reopen the preference panel at any time using <strong>Privacy choices</strong> in the site footer.</p><h2>Advertising</h2><p>The preference panel includes an advertising category for future compatibility, but this Analytics setup does not configure Google Ads. If advertising is introduced, this policy and the consent experience will be reviewed before activation.</p><h2>Contact messages</h2><p>If you email us, we receive the information you provide and use it to respond, maintain necessary records, prevent abuse, and improve the site. We do not sell contact details.</p><h2>Data retention and rights</h2><p>Information is retained only as reasonably needed for its stated purpose, security, legal obligations, or dispute resolution. Depending on your location, you may have rights to request access, correction, deletion, restriction, or objection.</p><h2>Contact</h2><p>Questions or privacy requests can be sent to <a href="mailto:hello@mushroomscope.com">hello@mushroomscope.com</a>.</p></div></article></BaseLayout>
